{# Java cross-package POJO template — emits
src/main/java/org/prebid/server/proto/openrtb/ext/request/{bidder}/ExtImp{Bidder}.java

Inputs:
  ctx.bidder_name        : str  — Java YAML / package name (lowercase + drop non-[a-z0-9])
  ctx.bidder_class_root  : str  — PascalCase class root (e.g., "Kobler", "AdkernelAdn"); via lookup table or Rule 46 + Java edge case #26-27
  ctx.fields             : list[dict]  — per-field translation; each:
      java_name      : str  — Java field name (camelCase, matches the JSON property name in most cases)
      json_property  : str  — wire-format JSON property name (passed to @JsonProperty)
      java_type      : str  — fully-resolved Java type ("String", "Integer", "List<String>", "ExtImp{Bidder}Nested", etc.)
      omit_when_null : bool — whether to add @JsonInclude(JsonInclude.Include.NON_NULL) (rare; default false)
      notes          : str|null  — single-line comment to emit ABOVE the field; null → no comment
  ctx.has_builder        : bool — emit @Builder(toBuilder = true) annotation (most adapters: false; appnexus/adverxo style: true)
  ctx.imports_extra      : list[str]  — extra imports beyond the canonical four; one fully-qualified import per entry; ALPHABETICALLY SORTED by caller
  ctx.javadoc_summary    : str|null  — class-level Javadoc summary (1-3 lines); null → no Javadoc

Canonical Lombok set: @Value(staticConstructor = "of") for immutable; +@Builder for
builder-style (Java edge case). @AllArgsConstructor is the upstream-canonical companion
when @Builder is present.

ImportOrder strict 3-group per checkstyle: java.* (none in canonical case),
javax.* (none in canonical case), then com.* + lombok.* + org.* alphabetically.

This template emits ASCII-only source — see references/java-artifact-shapes.md §4-6
for the LineLength≤120 + EmptyLineSeparator + ImportOrder constraints.
#}
